{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj48RNVqdAZhLvRM9fyG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*click*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant **thunk** echoes through the frame.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand before you — heavy oak, iron-banded, ancient grain running like dark rivers through my body. My hinges are cold black iron, forged long ago. My keyhole breathes a thin line of light from whatever lies beyond.\n\nThe lock is parsed. The mechanism has turned.\n\nBut I have not opened.\n\nI am **closed.**\n\nI wait for what comes next."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":120,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}